This package is the ECL-1 standard: its requirements, the agent and tool integration contract in the protocols and profiles, the evidence format with its trust-policy model and verification procedure, the offline verifier for the browser and the command line, the conformance tests with their expected results, the assessment procedures and checklist, sample evidence, the formal models of the design, the guides, and the governance and community papers of the ECL-1 Working Group.
